      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L07-ACTIVITY-001",
      "SourceSection": "7.1: More Than Factors",
      "SourceExcerpt": "\\(M\\) and \\(K\\) are both polynomial functions of \\(x\\) where \\(M(x)=(x+3)(2x-5)\\) and \\(K(x)= 3(x+3)(2x-5)\\).",
