    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L07-ACTIVITY-003",
      "SourceSection": "7.1: More Than Factors",
      "SourceExcerpt": "If a graphing window of \\(\\text-5 \\leq x \\leq 5\\) and \\(\\text-20 \\leq y \\leq 20\\) shows all intercepts of a graph of \\(y=M(x)\\), what graphing window would show all intercepts of \\(y=K(x)\\)?",
