      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L07-ACTIVITY-004",
      "SourceSection": "7.2: Choosing Windows",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Mai graphs the function \\(p\\) given by \\(p(x)=(x+1)(x-2)(x+15)\\) and sees this graph.",
